Attribution: this lane's C sources are an adaptation (restructured and
rewritten; see ADAPTATION-NOTES.md) of the public MIT-licensed reference
`wantorieta15/site-generator-speed-01-run-20261122-akun2-napi`
(https://github.com/wantorieta15/site-generator-speed-01-run-20261122-akun2-napi),
itself an implementation of the make.fun `site-generator-speed-01` reference
semantics (makefun-site 1.0.0). The reference's prebuilt `site` binary was
never executed; only its source text was read, and this lane's binary was
built solely from this lane's own adapted sources with gcc.
